## Description

A 27-year-old pointed Claude Code at 4,000 Obsidian notes and woke up to an employee he never hired.  6 years of notes. Ideas, half-finished essays, 212 book summaries all rotting in a folder he stopped opening in 2024.  Then he noticed something obvious that almost nobody uses. https://t.co/3egLub8Lcj

